cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "GALATEA: Grounding Generated Video Plans in Simulation Towards Versatile Dexterous Controllers"
type: software
abstract: >-
  GALATEA reconstructs 3D hand-object trajectories from generated videos and
  uses them as references to train one general hand-object tracking policy with
  reinforcement learning (RL): a single policy for many objects and trajectories
  that runs closed-loop on a real dexterous robot hand.
repository-code: "https://github.com/boyuan-an/GALATEA"
url: "https://boyuan-an.github.io/GALATEA/"
keywords:
  - dexterous manipulation
  - hand-object interaction
  - hand-object reconstruction
  - video generation
  - reinforcement learning
  - motion tracking
  - sim-to-real
